WEBVTT

00:00:01.675 --> 00:00:02.810
[RAPPING ON WINDOW]
HARRY! HARRY!

00:00:02.854 --> 00:00:04.507
HAPPY BIRTHDAY!

00:00:04.551 --> 00:00:06.640
[SCREECHES]

00:00:06.684 --> 00:00:08.207
Harry: WOW.

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:14.039
YOU ALL RIGHT, HARRY?

00:00:14.082 --> 00:00:16.302
YOU SEEM VERY QUIET.

00:00:16.345 --> 00:00:19.392
HE KILLED MY PARENTS,
DIDN'T HE?

00:00:19.435 --> 00:00:22.003
THE ONE
WHO GAVE ME THIS.

00:00:22.047 --> 00:00:24.179
YOU KNOW, HAGRID.

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:25.964
I KNOW YOU DO.

00:00:26.007 --> 00:00:27.748
[SIGHS]

00:00:27.792 --> 00:00:29.489
[PUSHES BOWL AWAY]

00:00:29.532 --> 00:00:31.665
FIRST--AND UNDERSTAND
THIS, HARRY,

00:00:31.709 --> 00:00:34.450
'CAUSE IT'S
VERY IMPORTANT--

00:00:34.494 --> 00:00:37.236
NOT ALL WIZARDS ARE GOOD.

00:00:37.279 --> 00:00:38.454
SOME OF THEM GO BAD.

00:00:38.498 --> 00:00:40.413
A FEW YEARS AGO,
THERE WAS ONE WIZARD

00:00:40.456 --> 00:00:42.110
WHO WENT AS BAD
AS YOU CAN GO.

00:00:42.154 --> 00:00:44.025
AND HIS NAME WAS V--

00:00:44.069 --> 00:00:45.461
[SIGHS]

00:00:45.505 --> 00:00:47.333
[SOFTLY]
HIS NAME WAS V--

00:00:47.376 --> 00:00:48.856
MAYBE IF YOU
WROTE IT DOWN?

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:50.292
NO, I CAN'T SPELL IT.

00:00:50.336 --> 00:00:52.077
ALL RIGHT.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.079
[WHISPERING]
Voldemort.

00:00:54.122 --> 00:00:56.429
VOLDEMORT?
SHH!

00:00:59.127 --> 00:01:01.564
IT WAS DARK TIMES, HARRY.
DARK TIMES.

00:01:03.741 --> 00:01:07.309
VOLDEMORT STARTED
TO GATHER SOME FOLLOWERS,

00:01:07.353 --> 00:01:09.790
BROUGHT 'EM OVER
TO THE DARK SIDE.

00:01:12.053 --> 00:01:15.100
ANYONE THAT STOOD UP
TO HIM ENDED UP DEAD.

00:01:16.275 --> 00:01:18.190
YOUR PARENTS FOUGHT
AGAINST HIM...

00:01:19.757 --> 00:01:22.020
BUT NOBODY LIVED
ONCE HE DECIDED TO KILL 'EM.

00:01:22.063 --> 00:01:23.935
[SCREAMING]

00:01:27.503 --> 00:01:30.158
NOBODY, NOT ONE.

00:01:30.202 --> 00:01:32.291
EXCEPT YOU.

00:01:34.815 --> 00:01:36.121
[WHISPERING]
Me?

00:01:36.164 --> 00:01:39.124
Voldemort tried
to kill...me?

00:01:39.167 --> 00:01:40.647
YES.

00:01:40.691 --> 00:01:43.345
THAT AIN'T NO ORDINARY CUT
ON YOUR FOREHEAD, HARRY.

00:01:43.389 --> 00:01:45.565
A MARK LIKE THAT
ONLY COMES

00:01:45.608 --> 00:01:47.349
FROM BEING TOUCHED
BY A CURSE

00:01:47.393 --> 00:01:48.916
AND AN EVIL CURSE AT THAT.

00:01:50.004 --> 00:01:53.573
WHAT HAPPENED TO VO--
TO YOU-KNOW-WHO?

00:01:53.616 --> 00:01:57.577
WELL, SOME SAY HE DIED.

00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:00.580
CODSWALLOP, IN MY OPINION.

00:02:00.623 --> 00:02:04.410
NOPE, I RECKON
HE'S OUT THERE STILL...

00:02:04.453 --> 00:02:07.500
TOO TIRED TO CARRY ON.

00:02:07.543 --> 00:02:09.720
BUT ONE THING'S
ABSOLUTELY CERTAIN.

00:02:09.763 --> 00:02:12.287
SOMETHING ABOUT YOU
STUMPED HIM THAT NIGHT.

00:02:12.331 --> 00:02:14.725
THAT'S WHY YOU'RE FAMOUS.

00:02:14.768 --> 00:02:17.510
THAT'S WHY EVERYBODY
KNOWS YOUR NAME.

00:02:17.553 --> 00:02:20.339
YOU'RE THE BOY WHO LIVED.

00:02:27.346 --> 00:02:29.348
[INDISTINCT P.A. ANNOUNCEMENT]

00:02:31.045 --> 00:02:32.699
WHAT'RE YOU LOOKIN' AT?

00:02:35.615 --> 00:02:37.138
BLIMEY!
IS THAT THE TIME?

00:02:37.182 --> 00:02:39.184
SORRY, HARRY, I'M GONNA
HAVE TO LEAVE YOU.

00:02:39.227 --> 00:02:41.708
DUMBLEDORE'LL BE
WANTIN' HIS, UH...

00:02:41.752 --> 00:02:43.536
WELL, HE'LL BE
WANTIN' TO SEE ME.

00:02:43.579 --> 00:02:46.713
NOW, UH, YOUR TRAIN
LEAVES IN 10 MINUTES.

00:02:46.757 --> 00:02:48.715
HERE'S YOUR TICKET.
STICK TO IT, HARRY.

00:02:48.759 --> 00:02:50.761
THAT'S VERY IMPORTANT.
STICK TO YOUR TICKET.

00:02:55.069 --> 00:02:56.016
"PLATFORM 9 3/4"?
